{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HL84C80AL51795058129.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價終止連續五天的升勢。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價報6.7128，較上個交易日下調10點子。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價早段於6.67水平上落，離岸價於6.66徘徊。</p><p></p><p>另外，人民銀行開展7,675億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作，扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨投放673億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T04:24:06.284478+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T02:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T14:11:45.430435+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T04:17:17.828249+00:00","content_hash":"10f69e147de09cdf5e99727c3601827137237f3ada78120f65abc1c4b3b7e580","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T04:24:06.284478+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}